# Files that are not website content. Cloudflare's static-asset deploy reads
# this file and does not upload what it matches (gitignore syntax).
# Without it the whole repo was public on the business domain:
# STATUS.md, README.md and every .claude/ skill (found 2026-10-12).
.assetsignore
.claude
.git
.github
.nojekyll
*.md
images/README.txt
